## ⚙️ Getting Started

No build tools. No `npm install`. No configuration. Just clone and open.

### Prerequisites

- A modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Git — to clone the repo

### Clone & Run

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/NietoDeveloper/PediatricNurseCare.git

# 2. Navigate into the project
cd PediatricNurseCare

# 3. Open directly in your browser — that's it
open index.html
```

> On Windows: double-click `index.html` or drag it into your browser.

### Live Server (optional, for development)

If you prefer hot-reload during edits:

```bash
# Using VS Code Live Server extension
# Right-click index.html → "Open with Live Server"

# Or using npx (one-time, no install)
npx serve .
```

---

## 🌐 Deployment

The site is deployed on **Netlify** with continuous deployment from the `main` branch.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  DEPLOY PIPELINE                         │
│                                                           │
│  git push origin main                                    │
│       │                                                   │
│       └──► Netlify detects push                          │
│            ├── Builds in ~5s (static — instant)          │
│            ├── Deploys to global CDN                     │
│            └── Live at monicaandramunio.netlify.app ✅    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Environment | URL |
|:------------|:----|
| **Production** | [monicaandramunio.netlify.app](https://monicaandramunio.netlify.app/) |
| **Local dev** | `index.html` (direct) or `localhost:3000` (Live Server) |

