## ✨ Core Features

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A([👩‍⚕️ Nurse Profile]) -->|Clear presentation| B[Professional Bio]
    B -->|Builds trust| C[Services Overview]
    C -->|Enables action| D[Contact Section]
    D -->|Direct outreach| E([💌 Patient / Family])

    style A fill:#A8DADC,color:#000,stroke:#A8DADC
    style E fill:#A8DADC,color:#000,stroke:#A8DADC
    style D fill:#1D3557,color:#fff,stroke:#1D3557
```

| Feature | Description |
|:--------|:------------|
| 👩‍⚕️ **Professional Profile** | Full bio, credentials, and specialization in pediatric care |
| 📋 **Services Section** | Clear, readable overview of what she offers |
| 📩 **Contact Section** | Direct call-to-action for families to reach out |
| 📱 **Responsive Design** | Flawless on mobile — where most parents browse |
| ⚡ **Instant Load** | No JS bundle, no framework overhead — loads in under 1s |
| 🌐 **Always Online** | Netlify global CDN with 99.9% uptime |

